### ONE 'O ONES Official Store - NestJS REST API Test Collection
### Gunakan ekstensi "REST Client" di VS Code (klik "Send Request" di atas setiap blok)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 0. Health / Root Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 1. GET - Ambil semua produk merchandise (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 2. GET - Ambil detail satu produk berdasarkan ID (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### 3. POST - Tambah produk merchandise baru (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "101-VNL-008",
  "name": "Ocean Echoes Acoustic Sessions EP Vinyl",
  "category": "Vinyl",
  "price": 42.5,
  "stock": 15,
  "editionBadge": "Signed Pressing",
  "description": "Piringan hitam 180g sesi akustik live dengan sleeve hologram dan lyric sheet eksklusif.",
  "icon": "sparkles",
  "themeColor": "cyan",
  "releaseDate": "2026-11-23",
  "isLimitedEdition": true
}

### 4. PATCH - Ubah sebagian data produk ID #8 (200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/8
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 45,
  "stock": 10,
  "editionBadge": "Tour Exclusive"
}

### 5. DELETE - Hapus produk ID #8 (200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/8

### 6. ERROR 1 - NotFoundException (404 Not Found): ID tidak ditemukan
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/999

### 7. ERROR 2 - ConflictException (409 Conflict): SKU duplikat sudah terdaftar
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "101-VNL-001",
  "name": "Astral Horizon Duplicate Test Vinyl",
  "category": "Vinyl",
  "price": 39,
  "stock": 10,
  "description": "Pengujian skenario ConflictException untuk SKU yang sudah digunakan.",
  "releaseDate": "2026-11-23"
}

### 8. ERROR 3 - BadRequestException (400 Bad Request): Validasi DTO gagal (ValidationPipe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "INVALID-SKU",
  "name": "AB",
  "category": "Elektronik",
  "price": -10,
  "stock": -5,
  "description": "Pendek",
  "releaseDate": "bukan-tanggal"
}

